From: OpenAI
Subject: [PATCH] SukiSU builtin-new: SUSFS registration and main-compatible sucompat

Fix the SUSFS extension registration and manual-hook type detection, and port
main's fd-based /data/adb/ksud exec flow to the builtin do_execveat_common
integration. The su-session driver fd is installed only after a successful
exec into ksud, matching supercall.c's contract and the main branch.

Base: SukiSU-Ultra builtin-new commit 548fbf243f70d65f5b8afc45516af63c07fa1958
UAPI: Keep KERNEL_SU_UAPI_VERSION 6; no uapi5.patch is needed.

---
